{"seq":8,"slug":"political-philosophy","title":"政治哲学","stage":"DONE","category":"philosophy-logic","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy","rating":{"composite":3.82,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"政治哲学-简介\">政治哲学 简介</h1><p>政治哲学是对政治生活根本问题的<strong>规范性</strong>反思：国家凭什么统治、权力何以正当、正义如何衡量、自由的边界在哪里、公民为何应当服从。它不描述政治&quot;是什么&quot;，而追问政治秩序&quot;应当是什么&quot;。这正是它在整个知识库中的独特坐标——本 hub 提供的是评判一切政治制度的<strong>价值标准与论证工具</strong>，而不是制度运作的实证知识或具体国家的历史。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一-本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">一、本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>政治哲学位于哲学（15）家族，但与多个 hub 紧邻。读者最常混淆的是&quot;政治哲学 vs 政治科学&quot;。简言之：政治哲学问&quot;什么样的民主是正当的&quot;，政治科学问&quot;民主如何运作、为何崩溃&quot;。下表厘清分工：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>08 政治哲学（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>政治秩序<strong>应当</strong>如何？正义、自由、合法性的规范标准</td>\n<td>提供评判标准的源头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democracy-theory/liberal-democracy\">22 政治科学</a></td>\n<td>政治<strong>实际</strong>如何运作：制度、政体、选举、国际关系</td>\n<td>实证对象；本 hub 给它价值标尺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../philosophy-of-law/\">15 法哲学</a></td>\n<td>法律的本质、守法义务、权利结构、惩罚正当性</td>\n<td>与本 hub 在权利/正义/义务议题上深度交叉，但聚焦&quot;法律&quot;这一规范系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ethics-foundations/\">03 伦理学基础</a></td>\n<td>个人<strong>应当</strong>如何行动：对错、善恶、德性</td>\n<td>政治哲学是把伦理追问放大到&quot;集体与制度&quot;层面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../marxism/class-theory-social-development/state-revolution/state-origin\">21 马克思主义</a></td>\n<td>阶级、资本、国家作为统治工具的批判理论</td>\n<td>对自由主义规范框架的批判性对照视角</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../sociology/social-stratification/poverty-exclusion/welfare-state-social-policy\">19 社会学</a></td>\n<td>不平等、社会运动、阶层、性别的<strong>经验</strong>研究</td>\n<td>为本 hub 的平等/正义争论提供实证内容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话定位：<strong>当你想知道某项政治安排&quot;对不对、该不该&quot;，来本 hub；想知道它&quot;怎么运转、效果如何&quot;，去 22/19；想知道它&quot;合不合法&quot;，去 15 法哲学。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"二-本-hub-结构与推荐学习路径\">二、本 hub 结构与推荐学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 四章呈&quot;概念基础 → 核心价值 → 制度权力 → 当代前沿&quot;的递进结构：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>政治哲学基础</strong>——社会契约论、自然权利、主权与合法性，搭建概念地基。</li>\n<li><strong>自由与正义</strong>——自由的多重面向、罗尔斯正义论、分配正义、平等争论，政治哲学的价值核心。</li>\n<li><strong>权力与国家</strong>——国家理论、民主理论、政治义务、公民不服从，把价值落到制度。</li>\n<li><strong>当代政治哲学</strong>——社群主义、女性主义、多元文化主义、全球正义，前沿张力。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>按人群推荐路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>初学者（系统打底）</strong>：严格按 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 顺序。第二章的<a href=\"liberty-justice/rawls-justice\">罗尔斯正义论</a>是全 hub 的枢纽，务必吃透。</li>\n<li><strong>关注公共事务的实践者</strong>：可从<a href=\"liberty-justice/concept-of-liberty\">自由的概念</a>与<a href=\"power-state/democracy-theory\">民主理论</a>切入，再回补第一章基础，最后看第四章当代议题。</li>\n<li><strong>技术 / AI 从业者</strong>：建议主线为<a href=\"liberty-justice/distributive-justice\">分配正义</a> → <a href=\"liberty-justice/equality-debate\">平等与差异</a> → <a href=\"contemporary-political/global-justice\">全球正义</a>，这些议题与算法公平、平台治理、数字权利直接相关；可延伸至 <a href=\"../ethics-foundations/tech-ethics/ai-ethics\">03 伦理学的 AI 伦理</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>批判理论取向</strong>：从<a href=\"foundations/social-contract\">社会契约论</a>（建制视角）出发，对照 <a href=\"../../marxism/class-theory-social-development/state-revolution/state-origin\">21 马克思主义的国家观</a>，再读第四章的<a href=\"contemporary-political/feminism-political\">女性主义政治哲学</a>与<a href=\"contemporary-political/multiculturalism\">多元文化主义</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"三-前置知识\">三、前置知识</h2><p>本 hub 不要求政治学专业背景，但具备以下基础会显著降低门槛：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>西方哲学史的轮廓</strong>：知道柏拉图、洛克、康德、黑格尔的大致位置即可，详见 <a href=\"../western-philosophy-history/\">09 西方哲学史</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>基本伦理学概念</strong>：功利主义、义务论、德性论的区分，是理解分配正义诸立场的钥匙，见 <a href=\"../ethics-foundations/\">03 伦理学基础</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>阅读论证的能力</strong>：政治哲学以&quot;思想实验 + 论证&quot;展开（如罗尔斯的无知之幕），重在跟随推理而非记忆结论。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无前置基础者也可直接从第一章读起，本 hub 每篇均自带概念铺垫。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"政治哲学基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-political-philosophy","title":"政治哲学导论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/foundations/what-is-political-philosophy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-contract","title":"社会契约论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/foundations/social-contract"},{"seq":3,"slug":"natural-rights","title":"自然权利学说","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/foundations/natural-rights"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sovereignty-legitimacy","title":"主权与合法性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/foundations/sovereignty-legitimacy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"liberty-justice","title":"自由与正义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/liberty-justice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"concept-of-liberty","title":"自由的概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/liberty-justice/concept-of-liberty"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rawls-justice","title":"罗尔斯正义论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/liberty-justice/rawls-justice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"distributive-justice","title":"分配正义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/liberty-justice/distributive-justice"},{"seq":4,"slug":"equality-debate","title":"平等与差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/liberty-justice/equality-debate"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-state","title":"权力与国家","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/power-state","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"state-theories","title":"国家理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/power-state/state-theories"},{"seq":2,"slug":"democracy-theory","title":"民主理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/power-state/democracy-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"authority-obligation","title":"权威与政治义务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/power-state/authority-obligation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"civil-disobedience","title":"公民不服从","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/power-state/civil-disobedience"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary-political","title":"当代政治哲学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/contemporary-political","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"communitarianism","title":"社群主义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/contemporary-political/communitarianism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feminism-political","title":"女性主义政治哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/contemporary-political/feminism-political"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multiculturalism","title":"多元文化主义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/contemporary-political/multiculturalism"},{"seq":4,"slug":"global-justice","title":"全球正义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/political-philosophy/contemporary-political/global-justice"}]}]}